text = "9/06/19XX

A terrible accident occurred at the mine in Oklahoma City.

After several miners got trapped underground after a landslide, after a mysterious explosion occurred, claiming many lives.

Whistleblowers took notice, claiming that the event may have been motivated by an act of terrorism..

The construction site had been built on a former mole digging sanctuary, and its desecration had caused quite a stir among the animal welfare movement.

Coal mining executives are already denouncing the event as a national scandal…
"
